            "review_title": "Review at Dovado Pizza",
            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nInteresting concept but need further development\nOct 2021 • Solo\nThey specialised in using sweet potatoes to make the dough. Interesting idea but I think they need to develop that further. The sweetness of sweet potato overwhelmed other ingredients so much that sometime I felt like eating a cake with seafoods toppings. If they could find the right balance, I think this could be very interesting. The price is not cheap but considering they are in a planned shopping/food area, I don't think it's unreasonable.\nRead more\nWritten November 3, 2021",
